    "text": "Doubtful points are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>n</mi></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;<br />Clearly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LHL</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>RHL</mi><mo>,</mo></math> <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;all cannot be equal for any <math><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi></math><br />Hence, discontinuous at all integeral values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>",
